{"id": "86095", "name": "פולינום x² + bx + c ששורשיו הם b ו-c (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find a quadratic,</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x^2 +bx +c, \\]</p><p>other than \\(x^2\\), which has roots equal to \\(b\\) and \\(c\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Write the quadratic through its roots, compare coefficients with \\(x^2+bx+c\\), and solve the two equations for \\(b\\) and \\(c\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The quadratic from its roots</b><br>Since \\(b\\) and \\(c\\) are the roots, we have<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (x-b)(x-c) =0. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Comparing coefficients</b><br>Expanding this, and comparing coefficients, we have that<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left.\n\\begin{array}{rcl}\nb+c  =   -b \\\\\nbc  =  c\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\n\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Solving for \\(b\\) and \\(c\\)</b><br><p>From the second of these equations, either \\(b=1\\) or \\(c=0\\).</p><p>If \\(c=0\\), the first gives \\(b=0\\), resulting in \\(x^2\\).</p><p>If \\(b=1\\), then \\(c=-2\\), giving only one other solution</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (x+2)(x-1) = x^2 +x -2.\\]</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em\">(By Teiji Nakazawa, Mathematical Gazette, No. 358, pg 315, 1962)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "x^2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "x^2", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Yes, \\(x^2\\) is correct, but you need to give another answer!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "(x+2)*(x-1)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}